      "act": "show-tell",
      "lane": "manim",
      "proof_gate": "SHOW",
      "narration_text": "Classical probability begins with symmetry. A fair coin gives heads one of two ways. A bag with five differently colored balls gives yellow one of five ways. Favorable outcomes over total outcomes is the Laplace formula.",
