      "act": "show-tell",
      "lane": "manim",
      "proof_gate": "SHOW",
      "narration_text": "Frequentist probability repeats a stable experiment. Seven heads in twenty tosses is seven twentieths. As the number of trials grows, the relative frequency approaches the probability, provided the process stays stable.",
